            <ArticleTitle>Finally, Attention Switches To Progressive Multiple Sclerosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The surge of new MS treatments have been for the relapsing-remitting form of the disease. There's hope for sufferers of a different form of MS. By homing in on CD20-positive B cells, ocrelizumab is able to knock them out and other aberrant B cells circulating in the bloodstream.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
